  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transparency and Accountability Interventions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Purpose:  To enable policymakers, donors, practitioners and expert to access new evidence for improving health policies from transparency and accountability interventions, through generation of high quality research and evidence on impact, generalizability and scalability of interventions; dissemination of results; and strengthened capacity.  This will benefit populations by 2017&#x2013; particularly in Tanzania and Indonesia where the research will be implemented -  as well as other developing countries, through more robust and accountable health policies and interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
